cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QuickScope, please cite the QuickScope paper."
title: "QuickScope: certifying hard questions in dynamic LLM benchmarks"
abstract: "QuickScope finds where a language model fails reliably on a dynamic benchmark: the configurations of a question generator whose questions the model keeps getting wrong. Built on COUP, it spends model calls adaptively and certifies a configuration as hard with a confidence bound."
type: software
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23573835"
